20the%20constructor%20instead.%0A%20%20%27left%27%2C%20%27right%27%2C%20%27inleft%27%2C%20%27inright%27%2C%20%27Some%27%2C%20%27None%27%2C%20%27pair%27%2C%20%27inl%27%2C%20%27inr%27%2C%20%27exist%27%2C%20%27existT%27%2C%20%27I%27%2C%20%27conj%27%2C%20%27or_introl%27%2C%0A%20%20%27or_intror%27%2C%20%27ex_intro%27%2C%20%27eq_refl%27%2C%20%27Eq%27%2C%20%27Lt%27%2C%20%27Gt%27%2C%20%27CompEq%27%2C%20%27CompLt%27%2C%20%27CompGt%27%2C%20%27xI%27%2C%20%27xO%27%2C%20%27xH%27%2C%20%27N0%27%2C%20%27Npos%27%2C%20%27Z0%27%2C%0A%20%20%27Zpos%27%2C%20%27Zneg%27%2C%20%27ReflectT%27%2C%20%27ReflectF%27%2C%20%27identity_refl%27%2C%0A%5D%29%3B%0A%0Aexport%20const%20ROCQ_PRELUDE%20%3D%20%5B%0A%20%20%27From%20Stdlib%20Require%20Import%20NArith%20ZArith%20Lia%20Recdef%20String%20List%20Ascii.%27%2C%0A%5D%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%20Number%20literals%20are%20written%20as%20in%20the%20source%3B%20Rocq%20reads%20each%20one%20as%20the%0A%2F%2F%20nearest%20float%2C%20as%20JavaScript%20does%2C%20and%20would%20otherwise%20warn%20that%20it%20rounds.%0Aconst%20FLOAT_PRELUDE%20%3D%20%5B%0A%20%20%27From%20Stdlib%20Require%20Import%20NArith%20ZArith%20Lia%20Recdef%20String%20List%20Ascii%20Floats.%27%2C%0A%20%20%27Set%20Warnings%20%22-inexact-float%22.%27%2C%0A%5D%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%20How%20many%20times%20one%20proof%20step%20rewrites%20with%20one%20hypothesis%20or%20lemma.%0Aconst%20REWRITE_BOUND%20%3D%208%3B%0A%0Aconst%20HELPERS%20%3D%20%7B%0A%20%20digits%3A%20%60Fixpoint%20ml_digits%20%28fuel%20%3A%20nat%29%20%28n%20%3A%20N%29%20%28acc%20%3A%20string%29%20%3A%20string%20%3A%3D%0A%20%20match%20fuel%20with%0A%20%20%7C%20O%20%3D%3E%20acc%0A%20%20%7C%20S%20rest%20%3D%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20let%20acc%27%20%3A%3D%20String%20%28ascii_of_N%20%2848%20%2B%20N.modulo%20n%2010%29%29%20acc%20in%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20N.ltb%20n%2010%20then%20acc%27%20else%20ml_digits%20rest%20%28N.div%20n%2010%29%20acc%27%0A%20%20end.%0ADefinition%20ml_N_to_string%20%28n%20%3A%20N%29%20%3A%20string%20%3A%3D%20ml_digits%20%28S%20%28N.size_n